<title>USA: Clinton Prairie SBC, Ind., won by First Chicago.</title>
<headline>Clinton Prairie SBC, Ind., won by First Chicago.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Chicago Capital Mkts., said it won $1.90 million of Clinton Prairie SBC, Ind., first mortgage bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.60 percent.</p>
</text>
